<figure class="tl__fig">
  <svg class="sv" viewBox="0 0 640 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="iron-t iron-d">
    <title id="iron-t">납땜 인두의 각 부분과 안전하게 잡는 법</title>
    <desc id="iron-d">인두 팁과 발열부는 매우 뜨겁다. 손잡이만 잡고, 쉬는 동안에는 받침대에 올리며, 전선이 팁에 닿지 않게 한다.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="ia" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path class="mk" d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z"/></marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- 받침대 -->
    <rect x="110" y="258" width="190" height="14" rx="3" fill="#6b7078"/>
    <rect x="132" y="208" width="8" height="50" fill="#6b7078"/>
    <rect x="228" y="208" width="8" height="50" fill="#6b7078"/>
    <path d="M128 208Q128 196 140 196M240 208Q240 196 228 196" fill="none" stroke="#6b7078" stroke-width="5"/>

    <!-- 인두 -->
    <path d="M52 178L100 168V188Z" fill="#9aa0a8" stroke="#6b7078" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    <path d="M52 178L64 175V181Z" fill="#33363c"/>
    <rect x="100" y="164" width="130" height="28" rx="3" fill="#c9ccd1" stroke="#8a8f98" stroke-width="2"/>
    <rect x="230" y="156" width="290" height="44" rx="10" fill="#4b5a74"/>
    <path d="M520 178C560 178 560 238 600 238" fill="none" stroke="#33363c" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>

    <!-- 뜨거운 곳 -->
    <rect x="46" y="150" width="190" height="50" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="var(--danger)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/>
    <text class="b c red" x="141" y="112">팁과 발열부</text>
    <text class="s c red" x="141" y="132">약 300~400℃ · 닿으면 화상</text>
    <path d="M141 136V146" stroke="var(--danger)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ia)"/>

    <!-- 잡는 곳 -->
    <rect x="236" y="150" width="278" height="56" rx="10" fill="none" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/>
    <text class="b c grn" x="375" y="112">손잡이</text>
    <text class="s c grn" x="375" y="132">여기만 잡습니다</text>
    <path d="M375 136V146" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ia)"/>

    <text class="s c" x="205" y="292">쉬는 동안은 받침대에</text>
    <text class="s" x="470" y="268">전선이 팁에 닿지 않게</text>
    <path d="M580 252V244" stroke="var(--ink2)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ia)"/>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>그림 4. 납땜 인두. 붉은 점선 구간은 뜨겁고, 초록 점선 구간만 손으로 잡습니다.</figcaption>
</figure>
